Example: The research team *is conducting* an experiment in the laboratory today.
Watch out: State verbs are not normally used with *-ing*: *This test contains 60 questions*, not *This test is containing 60 questions*.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"For actions happening now or temporary situations around the present."},{"label":"Look for","text":"*now*, *at the moment*, *currently*, *these days*, *Look!*, *Listen!*"},{"label":"Example","text":"The research team *is conducting* an experiment in the laboratory today."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"State verbs are not normally used with *-ing*: *This test contains 60 questions*, not *This test is containing 60 questions*."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-01-003-04-00';
UPDATE feedback_items SET heading = 'Present Perfect (*has/have* + past participle)', body = 'When to use: For past actions that matter now, life experiences, and situations that started in the past and continue now.
