Example: The study *shows* that regular study habits lead to higher scores.
Watch out: Verbs that describe states, thoughts or feelings (*know*, *believe*, *own*, *contain*) are not normally used with *-ing*: *I believe…*, not *I am believing…*.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"For facts, habits, routines and situations that are generally true, including the findings of a study."},{"label":"Look for","text":"*always*, *usually*, *often*, *rarely*, *every day*, and verbs such as *know*, *believe*, *seem* and *contain*."},{"label":"Example","text":"The study *shows* that regular study habits lead to higher scores."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Verbs that describe states, thoughts or feelings (*know*, *believe*, *own*, *contain*) are not normally used with *-ing*: *I believe…*, not *I am believing…*."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-01-003-25-00';
