Examples: Could you tell me *where the station is*? I don''t know *what time the film starts*.
Watch out: Do not use question order or *do* / *does* / *did*: *I wonder where he is*, not *I wonder where is he*; *what she wants*, not *what does she want*.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"When a *wh*- question (*what*, *where*, *how*, *why*, *which*) sits inside a longer sentence (*Do you know where…?*, *Tell me what…*)."},{"label":"Look for","text":"a question word in the middle of a sentence. After it, use normal statement order: subject + verb."},{"label":"Examples","text":"Could you tell me *where the station is*? I don''t know *what time the film starts*."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Do not use question order or *do* / *does* / *did*: *I wonder where he is*, not *I wonder where is he*; *what she wants*, not *what does she want*."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-04-017-25-00';
UPDATE feedback_items SET heading = 'Choices with *whether… or* / *whether or not*', body = 'When to use: To report a question that offers a choice between two options.
Look for: *or* or *or not* later in the sentence, or *or not* straight after the gap.
Example: We discussed *whether or not* to cancel the trip.
Watch out: Use *whether*, not *if*, directly before *or not*: *whether or not to go*, not *if or not to go*.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"To report a question that offers a choice between two options."},{"label":"Look for","text":"*or* or *or not* later in the sentence, or *or not* straight after the gap."},{"label":"Example","text":"We discussed *whether or not* to cancel the trip."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Use *whether*, not *if*, directly before *or not*: *whether or not to go*, not *if or not to go*."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-04-017-26-00';
