Watch out: *however* links sentences, not clauses: *It was late. However, we stayed*, not *It was late however we stayed*.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"To show a contrast or an unexpected result between two sentences."},{"label":"Key difference","text":"*however* / *nevertheless* = an unexpected result; *in contrast* / *on the other hand* = a comparison of two things."},{"label":"Example","text":"The test was difficult. *Nevertheless*, most students passed."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"*however* links sentences, not clauses: *It was late. However, we stayed*, not *It was late however we stayed*."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-05-025-26-00';
