Example: She *recommended that* he *revise* the paper.
Watch out: No *-s* and no past tense: *that he revise*, not *that he revises* or *that he revised*.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"After verbs of advising, requesting or demanding (*suggest*, *recommend*, *insist*, *demand*, *request*, *require*, *urge*)."},{"label":"Look for","text":"one of these verbs + *that* + subject. The next verb stays in its base form for every subject and tense."},{"label":"Example","text":"She *recommended that* he *revise* the paper."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"No *-s* and no past tense: *that he revise*, not *that he revises* or *that he revised*."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-09-041-16-00';
