Watch out: *decided to leave*, not *decided leaving*.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"After verbs about decisions, plans, promises and ability."},{"label":"Example","text":"We cannot *afford to buy* a new car."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"*decided to leave*, not *decided leaving*."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-12-059-11-00';
UPDATE feedback_items SET heading = '*remember* / *forget* / *regret* / *stop* / *try* + *-ing* or *to*', body = 'When to use: When the meaning depends on which form you choose.
Key difference: *remember* / *forget* + *-ing* = a past memory; + *to* = a task to do. *stop* + *-ing* = quit; + *to* = pause in order to. *try to* = make an effort.
Examples: I *remember leaving* my umbrella on the train. Please *remember to lock* the door.
Watch out: *stop smoking* means quit; *stop to smoke* means pause in order to smoke.', fields_json = '[{"label":"When to use","text":"When the meaning depends on which form you choose."},{"label":"Key difference","text":"*remember* / *forget* + *-ing* = a past memory; + *to* = a task to do. *stop* + *-ing* = quit; + *to* = pause in order to. *try to* = make an effort."},{"label":"Examples","text":"I *remember leaving* my umbrella on the train. Please *remember to lock* the door."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"*stop smoking* means quit; *stop to smoke* means pause in order to smoke."}]' WHERE feedback_code = '01-01-12-059-12-00';
UPDATE feedback_items SET heading = 'Verbs + *-ing* (*enjoy*, *avoid*, *suggest*, *admit*, *keep*)', body = 'When to use: After verbs about enjoyment, avoiding, suggesting, delaying and continuing.
